expression: text
---
Authentication management

Usage: dsp auth [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  login      Log in to a DSP server and cache the session token
  status     Show authentication status for a DSP server
  logout     Log out from a DSP server and clear the cached session token
  set-token  Cache a pre-issued bearer token read from stdin
  token      Print the resolved bearer token to stdout, for piping
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...             Increase log verbosity (-v=info, -vv=debug, -vvv=trace). RUST_LOG overrides
      --allow-insecure-server  Allow a non-local --server to use insecure http:// (see `dsp docs connecting`) [env: DSP_ALLOW_INSECURE_SERVER=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
